          "reason": "Copy the removed block before deletion so inventory never reads freed storage; release the temporary block after placement copies it into the map.",
          "verification": "Compiled real mouse-button Mine\u2192inventory\u2192Place fixture first fails missing earth after poisoned free, then detects leaked placement storage; both pass after repairs. Actual mobile browser shows inventory quantity1 after mining and empty slot/new tile after placing."
